      "importance": 78,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该功能将AI助手与个人健康数据结合，对用户隐私和医疗信息处理有重大影响，且由OpenAI官方发布，具有较高关注度。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "This feature combines AI assistant with personal health data, significantly impacting user privacy and medical information handling, and is officially released by OpenAI, attracting high attention.",
