      "titleZh": "ChatGPT推出健康功能",
      "titleEn": "Launching Health in ChatGPT",
      "summaryZh": "ChatGPT中的健康功能现允许符合条件的美国用户安全连接医疗记录和Apple Health，以获得更个性化的见解并更好地了解自己的健康状况。",
      "summaryEn": "Health in ChatGPT now lets eligible U.S. users securely connect medical records and Apple Health to get more personalized insights and better understand their health.",
